{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司宣佈，其長期運營的官方技術交流平台「Apple Support Community（蘋果支持社區）」將於2026年11月20日正式關閉。這意味着這個陪伴蘋果用户近25年的在線論壇即將結束歷史使命，未來用户將無法繼續在平台上發佈新問題或參與討論。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585876.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.476350+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:02:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.076418+00:00","content_hash":"964dbfd4785d6e4152758cabc2a7836e659a321990d8d6d894e04974b4440eb4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}